NOTE ON SCOPE — this file covers the CODE only.

The data in this repository and the data it derives from carry different terms.
See the "Data provenance and licensing" section of README.md. In short:

  - results/*.jsonl (transcriptions, predictions, derived metrics; no audio)
    follow the TEXTUAL half of SLURP and are intended for release under
    CC BY 4.0, with attribution to Bastianelli et al. (2020).
  - The degraded audio bank is NOT in this repository. It derives from SLURP
    AUDIO, which is CC BY-NC 4.0 (NonCommercial), and it inherits that term.
  - The NOISEX-92 babble track is NOT redistributed here in any form. It ships
    as a download script plus attribution.
